                    </div>
                    <span class="dept-status-pill">Women's Care</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Obstetrics & Women's Health</h3>
                <p>
                    Holistic care for women across all stages of life, including antenatal evaluations, reproductive endocrinology, routine screenings, and preventive gynecology.
                </p>
                <div class="dept-specialist-info">
                    <div class="spec-avatar bg-purple">AG</div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Dr. Ananya Gupta</strong>
                        <small>Gynecologist • Mon-Sat (10 AM - 1 PM)</small>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="dept-card-footer">
                    <a href="/doctors" class="dept-link">
