                    </div>
                    <span class="dept-status-pill">Bone & Joint</span>
                </div>
                <h3>Orthopedics & Joint Care</h3>
                <p>
                    Diagnostic management of musculoskeletal trauma, arthritis, sports injuries, ligament strains, and chronic joint and spine rehabilitation.
                </p>
                <div class="dept-specialist-info">
                    <div class="spec-avatar bg-emerald">KM</div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Dr. Karan Malhotra</strong>
                        <small>Orthopedic Surgeon • Mon-Sat (9 AM - 2 PM)</small>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="dept-card-footer">
                    <a href="/doctors" class="dept-link">
                        Consult Department <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 8. ENT Specialist -->
            <div class="dept-card-dark">
                <div class="dept-card-header">
                    <div class="dept-icon-box bg-cyan-glow">
                        <i class="fas fa-head-side-cough"></i>
                    </div>
                    <span class="dept-status-pill">ENT Clinic</span>
                </div>
                <h3>ENT & Head-Neck Clinic</h3>
                <p>
                    Diagnostic endoscopy, treatment for chronic sinusitis, allergic rhinitis, middle ear disorders, voice disturbances, and hearing assessments.
                </p>
                <div class="dept-specialist-info">
                    <div class="spec-avatar bg-cyan">VN</div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Dr. Vikram Nair</strong>
                        <small>ENT Specialist • Mon-Sat (11 AM - 5 PM)</small>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="dept-card-footer">
                    <a href="/doctors" class="dept-link">
                        Consult Department <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- AI CLINICAL SYMPTOM CHECKER & TRIAGE - ACTIVE & LIVE -->
<section class="ai-coming-soon-section" id="ai-symptom-section">
    <div class="section-container">
        <div class="ai-preview-card">
            <div class="ai-card-glow"></div>
            
            <div class="ai-badge-row">
                <span class="ai-status-pill" style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35); color: #34d399;">
                    <span class="live-pulse-cyan" style="background: #10b981; box-shadow: 0 0 10px #10b981;"></span>
                    <i class="fas fa-robot"></i> CLINICAL AI TRIAGE &bull; FULLY OPERATIONAL
                </span>
                <span class="ai-version-tag">AI Clinical Core v2.5 Live</span>
            </div>

            <div class="ai-header-content">
                <h2>Next-Generation AI Symptom Checker & Triage</h2>
                <p>
                    Experience intelligent clinical diagnostic assistance powered by medical Natural Language Processing (NLP). Our AI assistant analyzes reported symptoms in real time, calculates clinical triage urgency scores, and connects you instantly with the right verified medical specialist.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="ai-features-preview-grid">
                <div class="ai-feature-preview">
                    <div class="ai-feat-icon bg-cyan-glow">
                        <i class="fas fa-brain"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4>NLP Symptom Analysis</h4>
                    <p>Conversational symptom intake understanding natural descriptions of patient discomfort and pain severity.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="ai-feature-preview">
                    <div class="ai-feat-icon bg-purple-glow">
                        <i class="fas fa-heart-pulse"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4>Clinical Risk Triage</h4>
                    <p>Immediate risk categorization identifying urgent critical conditions vs routine outpatient visits.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="ai-feature-preview">
                    <div class="ai-feat-icon bg-blue-glow">
                        <i class="fas fa-network-wired"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h4>Smart Specialist Matching</h4>
                    <p>Automated recommendation of relevant hospital departments and on-duty doctors based on symptoms.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="ai-construction-banner" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.12), rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.08)); border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35);">
                <div class="banner-icon-box" style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); color: #34d399;">
                    <i class="fas fa-stethoscope"></i>
                </div>
                <div class="banner-text">
                    <strong>Clinical AI Assistant Is Active &amp; Ready</strong>
                    <p>Select your symptoms or describe your discomfort in natural language to receive instant triage recommendations and specialist matching.</p>
                </div>
                <div style="display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                    <a href="/symptom" class="btn-ai-preview" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #06b6d4); color: #fff; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.35);">
                        <i class="fas fa-robot"></i> Launch AI Symptom Checker
                    </a>
                    <a href="/doctors" class="btn-ai-preview" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);">
                        <i class="fas fa-user-md"></i> Consult Doctors
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- PUBLIC CONSULTATION ACTION BANNER -->
<section class="demo-cta-section">
    <div class="section-container">
        <div class="dark-cta-card">
            <div class="cta-inner-content">
                <span class="cta-tag"><i class="fas fa-calendar-check"></i> Outpatient & Specialist Care</span>
                <h2>Schedule Your Medical Consultation Today</h2>
                <p>
                    Book an appointment with leading specialists across 8 medical departments with flexible clinic hours and dedicated patient care.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="cta-inner-buttons">
                <% if (currentUser) { %>
                    <a href="/dashboard" class="btn-glow-cyan">
                        <i class="fas fa-calendar-plus"></i> Book Consultation
                    </a>
                <% } else { %>
                    <a href="/login" class="btn-glow-cyan">
                        <i class="fas fa-calendar-plus"></i> Book Consultation
                    </a>
                    <a href="/register" class="btn-dark-glass">
                        <i class="fas fa-user-plus"></i> New Patient Sign Up
                    </a>
                    <a href="/doctor/apply" class="btn-dark-outline">
                        <i class="fas fa-stethoscope text-cyan"></i> Join as Doctor
                    </a>
                <% } %>
                <a href="/doctors" class="btn-dark-outline">
                    <i class="fas fa-user-md"></i> Doctor Directory
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>